# never: the game
*.nes

# The src/ mirror is the recreated source; SLOT*.SRC are raw cartridge regions
# written out as `addr: bytes  mnemonic`. That is cartridge-derived content and
# src/README.md says none of it belongs in the tree ("no hex blobs, base64 or
# incbin of it"). They stay on the machine that made them.
src/SLOT*.SRC

# Runtime artefacts.
states/
shots/
logs/*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
